Subscribe and build with me.

204
00:09:19,796 --> 00:09:22,176
Next time: you know
whether customers want it.

205
00:09:22,576 --> 00:09:24,136
But who else already serves them?

206
00:09:24,456 --> 00:09:26,136
How to read the competitive battlefield.
